@Wait WaitMode:0.5

[PrintTextModified Text:我把剑放回保险箱，并关上了门。|#0203Adv01_Narrative020| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（……感觉五脏六腑都要冰透了。<br>　差不多该去调查其他地方了）|#0203Adv01_Hiro009|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

