[PrintTextModified Text:"（无法抑制的杀人冲动……<br>　奈叶香的魔女化就是在那时一下子加深了的吧）|#0203Adv01_Hiro010|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:"（而魔女化程度越深，<br>　魔法能力也会随之爆发性增强）|#0203Adv01_Hiro011|" AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

