[PrintTextModified Text:看到这里，我关闭了录像，攥紧了手机。|#0203Adv01_Narrative033| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（……一定要消灭这罪恶的源头）|#0203Adv01_Hiro015| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:被囚禁的一众少女已经是受害者了，<br>绝不能让无辜的人再这样继续牺牲。|#0203Adv01_Narrative034| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:（我要亲手找出大魔女，裁决她）|#0203Adv01_Hiro016| AuthorId:Hiro RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

[PrintTextModified Text:这才是我应当贯彻的道路。|#0203Adv01_Narrative035| RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

